					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "TAU\nThis node outputs the Tau constant.\n\n- Patch Explained -\n\n• The Tau constant is used as the amplitude for the Saw oscillator.\n• Sine and Cosine of the oscillator are used to compute the X and Y translation of the circle.\n•.This makes the circle move in a circular fashion\n"
					}
				},
